{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05552","headline":"南州行 · 徐延寿","name":"南州行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇艇至南国，国门连大江。\n中洲西边岸，数步一垂杨。\n金钏越溪女，罗衣胡粉香。\n织缣春卷幔，采蕨暝提筐。\n弄瑟娇垂幌，迎人笑下堂。\n河头浣衣处，无数紫鸳鸯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}